Vacation. Full-time employees receive 25 vacation days per year. Part-time employees receive a pro-rated amount. Up to 5 unused days may be carried over into the next year; the rest expire on 31 March.

Remote work. Employees may work remotely up to 3 days per week. A fully remote arrangement requires approval from a department head. Core collaboration hours are 10:00 to 15:00 Central European Time.

Expenses. Expenses below 100 euros need no pre-approval. Anything above 100 euros requires manager approval before purchase. Receipts must be submitted within 30 days through the expense portal. Alcohol is not reimbursable.

Probation. The probation period is 6 months. Either side can end the employment during probation with 2 weeks notice.

Equipment. Every new employee receives a laptop and a one-time home-office stipend of 200 euros, paid in the first month.

Learning budget. Each employee has an annual learning budget of 1,500 euros for courses and conferences.
